,["path",{"d":"M16 2v3","key":"otl347"}],["rect",{"x":"3","y":"3","width":"18","height":"18","rx":"2","key":"h1oib"}],["path",{"d":"M3 9h18","key":"1pudct"}],["path",{"d":"M8 13h.01","key":"1sbv64"}],["path",{"d":"M12 13h.01","key":"y0uutt"}],["path",{"d":"M16 13h.01","key":"wip0gl"}],["path",{"d":"M8 17h.01","key":"p3bg7i"}],["path",{"d":"M12 17h.01","key":"p32p05"}],["path",{"d":"M16 17h.01","key":"ql8jdd"}]],"className":"lucide-calendar-days size-4"}],"14 February 2022"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"M12 6v6l4 2","key":"mmk7yg"}]],"className":"lucide-clock size-4"}],"6 min read"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[#e8edf5] dark:bg-slate-900","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site grid gap-10 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_13rem] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[[["$","section","Overview",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Overview"}],[["$","p","Technology has simplified our lives to a considerable extent. However, we’ve got several societal, commercial, and holistic global concerns hovering over us and waiting for innovative and comprehensive new-age solutions. We’ve entered an era where the world talks about happiness and satisfaction through everything it does. Hence, we cannot have people that limit themselves to talking about things and providing fleeting solutions.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Technology has simplified our lives to a considerable extent. However, we’ve got several societal, commercial, and holistic global concerns hovering over us and waiting for innovative and comprehensive new-age solutions. We’ve entered an era where the world talks about happiness and satisfaction through everything it does. Hence, we cannot have people that limit themselves to talking about things and providing fleeting solutions."}],"$L1c","$L1d"]]}],"$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d"],"$L2e"]}],"$L2f"]}]}]]}],"$L30","$L31"]
1c:["$","p","Instead, we need a generation that looks at the larger picture, acts in the present, and works for the future. In other words, we need people who can collaborate and make the world a better place to live!",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Instead, we need a generation that looks at the larger picture, acts in the present, and works for the future. In other words, we need people who can collaborate and make the world a better place to live!"}]
1d:["$","p","Again, simply stated, we need individuals who can work out solutions for the planet, have decision-making abilities, and not those who dwell on problems and allow them to aggravate.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Again, simply stated, we need individuals who can work out solutions for the planet, have decision-making abilities, and not those who dwell on problems and allow them to aggravate."}]
1e:["$","section","The Sustainable Learning Solution",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"The Sustainable Learning Solution"}],[["$","p","So, how is all of it possible? How do we ensure we do what is necessary for us to thrive? It all begins from learning, and getting things right, right from the beginning! It involves building a generation that, besides doing well for itself, is aligned with global concerns and resonates with the world to develop appropriate solutions.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"So, how is all of it possible? How do we ensure we do what is necessary for us to thrive? It all begins from learning, and getting things right, right from the beginning! It involves building a generation that, besides doing well for itself, is aligned with global concerns and resonates with the world to develop appropriate solutions."}],["$","p","Globally, experts look at integrated learning as the solution. Integrated learning is a modern-age approach that focuses on developing problem-solving capabilities and also emphasizes developing the inherent skills and talent of every individual. It involves giving students real-life experiences and preparing them for the future.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Globally, experts look at integrated learning as the solution. Integrated learning is a modern-age approach that focuses on developing problem-solving capabilities and also emphasizes developing the inherent skills and talent of every individual. It involves giving students real-life experiences and preparing them for the future."}],["$","p","This blog talks about a few aspects associated with the significance of integrated learning. It explores the concept of integrated learning, the vital characteristics of integrated learning. Also, it discusses some of the crucial benefits of adopting an integrated learning culture in the modern-day learning environment.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"This blog talks about a few aspects associated with the significance of integrated learning. It explores the concept of integrated learning, the vital characteristics of integrated learning. Also, it discusses some of the crucial benefits of adopting an integrated learning culture in the modern-day learning environment."}]]]}]
1f:["$","section","What is Integrated Learning?",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"What is Integrated Learning?"}],[["$","p","Integrated learning is an innovative learning system that combines classroom learning and solutions to real-world problems. It is an effective form of learning that helps students leverage insights, their inherent talent, and skills developed through learning to devise innovative solutions to modern challenges and complex issues. Precisely, integrated learning includes the following elements to make education more useful and relevant.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Integrated learning is an innovative learning system that combines classroom learning and solutions to real-world problems. It is an effective form of learning that helps students leverage insights, their inherent talent, and skills developed through learning to devise innovative solutions to modern challenges and complex issues. Precisely, integrated learning includes the following elements to make education more useful and relevant."}]]]}]
20:["$","section","Combination of Multiple Elements",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Combination of Multiple Elements"}],[["$","p","Creating a productive and aligned generation requires great teachers, a relevant curriculum, and instant and useful assessment to ensure holistic learning excellence. In this view, integrated learning leverages the collective power of curriculum development, review, and faculty development.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Creating a productive and aligned generation requires great teachers, a relevant curriculum, and instant and useful assessment to ensure holistic learning excellence. In this view, integrated learning leverages the collective power of curriculum development, review, and faculty development."}]]]}]
21:["$","section","The Primary Focus is Problem-Solving",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"The Primary Focus is Problem-Solving"}],[["$","p","Problem-solving is a skill and an approach developed through the right education and providing students exposure to real-world problems, experiences, and putting their abilities to the test. It helps students resolve complex issues and tackle complex challenges that further help them develop their value as professionals as well as human beings, and in turn, deliver value to the people around them.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Problem-solving is a skill and an approach developed through the right education and providing students exposure to real-world problems, experiences, and putting their abilities to the test. It helps students resolve complex issues and tackle complex challenges that further help them develop their value as professionals as well as human beings, and in turn, deliver value to the people around them."}]]]}]
22:["$","section","Use of Information",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Use of Information"}],[["$","p","Integrated learning involves educational techniques that help students explore information and use it effectively to leverage it and develop solutions that can make a positive difference to a particular situation. Besides, it promotes a research-based approach that enables students to find out an answer to a solution, rather than refer to those ready across various sources.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Integrated learning involves educational techniques that help students explore information and use it effectively to leverage it and develop solutions that can make a positive difference to a particular situation. Besides, it promotes a research-based approach that enables students to find out an answer to a solution, rather than refer to those ready across various sources."}]]]}]
23:["$","section","Diverse Learning",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Diverse Learning"}],[["$","p","Integrated learning is a diverse learning method. It includes a range of learning approaches, styles, and patterns and develops multiple intelligences to adapt to global learning practices and increase competence.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Integrated learning is a diverse learning method. It includes a range of learning approaches, styles, and patterns and develops multiple intelligences to adapt to global learning practices and increase competence."}]]]}]
24:["$","section","Development of Various Skills",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Development of Various Skills"}],[["$","p","Integrated learning is a modern learning approach that focuses on the development of futuristic skills that will help students enhance their value across the professional as well as the personal and societal front. It includes developing skills and approaches such as creativity, critical reasoning, adaptability, and collaboration to ensure students look at every problem in an organized way and formulate a solution accordingly.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Integrated learning is a modern learning approach that focuses on the development of futuristic skills that will help students enhance their value across the professional as well as the personal and societal front. It includes developing skills and approaches such as creativity, critical reasoning, adaptability, and collaboration to ensure students look at every problem in an organized way and formulate a solution accordingly."}]]]}]
25:["$","section","Advantages of Integrated Learning",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Advantages of Integrated Learning"}],[["$","p","Let us explore some of the advantages of integrated learning.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Let us explore some of the advantages of integrated learning."}]]]}]
26:["$","section","A Better Understanding of Concepts",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"A Better Understanding of Concepts"}],[["$","p","Integrated learning focuses on comprehensive learning through an in-depth understanding, retention, and practical application of concepts rather than memorizing them blindly. It adopts various innovative learning approaches and teaching techniques that help students understand every element of a particular concept through real-world examples, collaborative learning, case studies, videos, and many others.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Integrated learning focuses on comprehensive learning through an in-depth understanding, retention, and practical application of concepts rather than memorizing them blindly. It adopts various innovative learning approaches and teaching techniques that help students understand every element of a particular concept through real-world examples, collaborative learning, case studies, videos, and many others."}]]]}]
27:["$","section","Develops Innovative and Higher Level Thinking",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Develops Innovative and Higher Level Thinking"}],[["$","p","Students develop innovative and higher-level thinking that requires out-of-the-box solutions. Integrated learning helps students look at problems in an organized manner, think logically, understand the root cause of a particular problem, and formulate an advanced, innovative, and sustainable solution.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Students develop innovative and higher-level thinking that requires out-of-the-box solutions. Integrated learning helps students look at problems in an organized manner, think logically, understand the root cause of a particular problem, and formulate an advanced, innovative, and sustainable solution."}]]]}]
28:["$","section","Encourages Active Participation",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Encourages Active Participation"}],[["$","p","Integrated learning encourages active participation in learning and relevant real-life experiences. It identifies and triggers the common or individual point of interest of students and enables them to participate and contribute. Besides, integrated learning focuses on letting students explore possibilities to a particular situation and come up with their collaborative solutions to it.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Integrated learning encourages active participation in learning and relevant real-life experiences. It identifies and triggers the common or individual point of interest of students and enables them to participate and contribute. Besides, integrated learning focuses on letting students explore possibilities to a particular situation and come up with their collaborative solutions to it."}],["$","p","Such early exposure to real-life problems and situations stimulates a sense of responsibility among students – something which isn’t possible, or isn’t included in conventional learning practices and approaches, wherein it is only the set of intelligent students that takes the initiative, leaving the intellectually weaker group behind.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Such early exposure to real-life problems and situations stimulates a sense of responsibility among students – something which isn’t possible, or isn’t included in conventional learning practices and approaches, wherein it is only the set of intelligent students that takes the initiative, leaving the intellectually weaker group behind."}]]]}]
29:["$","section","Development of Self-Awareness and Solution-Oriented Approach",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Development of Self-Awareness and Solution-Oriented Approach"}],[["$","p","Knowing oneself well and developing a solution-oriented approach are key factors leading to success in the modern age. One of the many benefits of integrated learning is that it increases self-awareness and empowers students with the ability to think about solutions, rather than crib about the problem or keep worrying about it.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Knowing oneself well and developing a solution-oriented approach are key factors leading to success in the modern age. One of the many benefits of integrated learning is that it increases self-awareness and empowers students with the ability to think about solutions, rather than crib about the problem or keep worrying about it."}]]]}]
2a:["$","section","Development of Decision-Making Abilities",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Development of Decision-Making Abilities"}],[["$","p","Solutions and approaches are all practically useless if an individual cannot make decisions. A lot of people, except for those having inherent decision-making abilities, cannot make decisions, as either they were never encouraged to do so or never taught.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Solutions and approaches are all practically useless if an individual cannot make decisions. A lot of people, except for those having inherent decision-making abilities, cannot make decisions, as either they were never encouraged to do so or never taught."}],["$","p","Considering the fact that the world needs leaders that can leverage every available insight and make informed decisions, adopting integrated learning comes in as a critical strategy. It involves putting students through various challenges, encouraging them to develop solutions, and making timely decisions to implement them.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Considering the fact that the world needs leaders that can leverage every available insight and make informed decisions, adopting integrated learning comes in as a critical strategy. It involves putting students through various challenges, encouraging them to develop solutions, and making timely decisions to implement them."}]]]}]
2b:["$","section","Making Valuable Contributions to Society",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Making Valuable Contributions to Society"}],[["$","p","Integrated learning enables students to look beyond themselves and encourages them to be useful to society and make valuable contributions to it. Further, it helps them recognize and understand the purpose of their life and also promotes the significance of living a meaningful life, rather than reducing themselves to becoming a money-making machine or turning out to be an excessively and exclusively career-oriented generation.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Integrated learning enables students to look beyond themselves and encourages them to be useful to society and make valuable contributions to it. Further, it helps them recognize and understand the purpose of their life and also promotes the significance of living a meaningful life, rather than reducing themselves to becoming a money-making machine or turning out to be an excessively and exclusively career-oriented generation."}]]]}]
2c:["$","section","Why should the Education Ecosystem Adopt Integrated Learning?",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Why should the Education Ecosystem Adopt Integrated Learning?"}],[["$","p","More than an approach, integrated learning is the new way of learning! It is competitive and relevant in view of the current and futuristic needs of the world. Schools, colleges, and universities must promote and adopt integrated learning approaches for themselves to stay competitive and produce contributors that are focused, aware, and passionate about making a difference to the world!",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"More than an approach, integrated learning is the new way of learning! It is competitive and relevant in view of the current and futuristic needs of the world. Schools, colleges, and universities must promote and adopt integrated learning approaches for themselves to stay competitive and produce contributors that are focused, aware, and passionate about making a difference to the world!"}]]]}]
2d:["$","section","Adopt Integrated Learning with CITIS",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Adopt Integrated Learning with CITIS"}],[["$","p","CITIS is a leading EduTech company with years of experience guiding and handholding schools, colleges, and universities to adopt integrated learning in the most appropriate, competent, and relevant manner. As a modern-day setup itself, CITIS is mindful of the new-age expectations of the world from education and the exigent need to bridge the gap between global needs and education.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"CITIS is a leading EduTech company with years of experience guiding and handholding schools, colleges, and universities to adopt integrated learning in the most appropriate, competent, and relevant manner. As a modern-day setup itself, CITIS is mindful of the new-age expectations of the world from education and the exigent need to bridge the gap between global needs and education."}],["$","p","CITIS prepares the roadmap to integrated learning after a careful assessment, review, and consideration of the existing situation and the futuristic needs. The company’s experts enable educators to implement various integrated learning programs and help them upgrade them to meet the ever-evolving societal and professional needs. For more information, connect with CITIS at +91 20 2567 70 60.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"CITIS prepares the roadmap to integrated learning after a careful assessment, review, and consideration of the existing situation and the futuristic needs. The company’s experts enable educators to implement various integrated learning programs and help them upgrade them to meet the ever-evolving societal and professional needs. For more information, connect with CITIS at +91 20 2567 70 60."}]]]}]
2e:["$","aside",null,{"className":"mt-12 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-accent bg-primary/5 p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-heading text-xl font-semibold","children":"The practical takeaway"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-muted-foreground","children":"Start with one meaningful learner outcome, create an authentic way to observe it, and support educators to improve the experience together."}]]}]
